<title>CHINA: China oil imports up 61 pct in Jan-Aug - customs. [CORRECTED 05:16 GMT]</title>
<headline>China oil imports up 61 pct in Jan-Aug - customs. [CORRECTED 05:16 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of crude oil soared by 61 percent in the first eight months to 14.3 million tonnes compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed.</p>
<p>Imports of oil products rose by 16.9 percent to 10.05 million tonnes compared with a year ago, the figures showed.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of tonnes)</p>
<p>			    Jan-Aug 1996	   Jan-Aug 1995</p>
<p> Crude Oil Imports     14.30		    8.88</p>
<p> Oil Product Imports   10.05		    8.60</p>
<p>(Corrects the the table to Imports from Exports)</p>
</text>
